<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US">
My hometown is a small coastal town in central Vietnam, and what I like most about living there is the relaxed pace of life.
Everyone knows each other, and the streets are quiet in the evening, so I can walk along the beach after work without feeling stressed.
Although the town is not very modern, the fresh seafood and the friendly neighbours make it a place where I feel completely at home.
</speak>
